        "title": "Relink a project to a local workspace folder",
        "summary": "Project Settings and the agent tool surface both gained a way to point a project at a specific local folder on the current Desktop machine, or clear the override.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Project Settings now exposes a folder picker for attaching a per-machine local workspace path, backed by a new PATCH-style API that accepts an absolute path or null to clear the override.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "88258ba86b3268a39f524913ef12ef4031f3925a"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Agents get a new platform-trust set_project_workspace tool, scoped to the bound project, so an assistant can attach or clear the local workspace folder on the user's Desktop machine through the standard tool permission catalog.",
            "commit_shas": [
